The '''Enderman Pet''' is a {{Skill|Combat}} [[Pet]].

== Obtaining ==
The '''Enderman Pet''' can be obtained by killing {{MobSprite|Enderman;Endermen}} or {{MobSprite|Voidling Fanatic;Voidling Fanatics}} in {{Zone|The End}}. The possible rarities depend on the mob's level.

